  "title": "Caramel Pecan Cheesecake",
  "description": "This caramel pecan cheesecake has a nutty crust, and a creamy cinnamon-spiced filling. Top with crunchy pecans and caramel for a delicious holiday dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "LADYDELTA"
  ],
